// The master missing-art catalogue, Oct 28: the style locks (pasted once per ChatGPT session, see docs/art/art_batch_oct28.md) and
// every wanted picture as a row. `node tools/art_batch_oct28.js` writes docs/art/art_batch_oct28.csv and the counts of the .md.
// Row fields: id, cat, zone, name, purpose, where, standin, size, dest, file, prio (High/Medium/Low), lock (a LOCKS key), desc, notes.
// A character's look is written ONCE (CHARS / FOES) and reused by its portrait, sprite set, cut-out and Bestiary square so they match.

